+## Board Publications
+
+Boards can be published to make them readable by anyone who has the secret public URL. Only board administrators can publish or unpublish a board.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes a board, generating its public URL.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created`.
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes a board, revoking access through its public URL.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content`.
+
+The published board, its columns, and its published cards can be viewed without authentication at:
+
+- `GET /public/boards/:key`
+- `GET /public/boards/:key/columns/:id`
+- `GET /public/boards/:key/cards/:number`
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
